Assumption challenge
  Vertices need not be the original tournament vertices.
  Useful vertex sets here include reversed intervals, block modules, macro-runs,
  ordered path-cover segments, automorphism cycles, H-values, and proof obligations.
  THM-410 preserves exact cyclic-triangle witnesses but destroys nonmatching flips.
  Square substitution preserves modular decomposition and block H-data but destroys
  prime/indecomposable tournaments outside the imprimitive slice.
